WEBVTT

00:00.150 --> 00:01.979
A sliver that grows.

00:02.679 --> 00:07.733
Now the Moon as the Earth sees it, with ten hours passing every second.

00:08.183 --> 00:16.166
Just after new Moon it stands almost between us and the Sun, so its lit half faces away and we see only a thin edge.

00:16.616 --> 00:21.039
Each evening it has moved a little further round, and shows us more.
